  "as_of": "2017-02-09",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would make donations to the 2017 Bourke Street Fund Trust Account tax deductible by specifically listing the fund in income tax legislation.",
   "Eligible gifts of $2 or more made after 20 January 2017 and before 21 January 2022 would qualify, subject to existing income tax requirements.",
   "The fund supports victims of the Melbourne incident and their immediate families, and the amendments would commence at the next quarter after Royal Assent."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The fund would be added by name to the statutory deductible gift recipient list.",
   "A time-limited eligibility period would govern which gifts receive tax deductions.",
   "The income tax law’s gift recipient index would be updated to include the fund."
  ],
  "affected": "Donors to the Bourke Street Fund and the fund supporting victims and their immediate families are affected.",
